mmol) of a 0.5 M solution of ethynylmagnesium bromide to give 1.15 g
(96%) of 1-[2-(2-methylbut-2-enyl)-phenyl]prop-2-yn-1-ol (20c) as a pale
yellow oil: 1-[2-(2-methylbut-2-enyl)-phenyl]prop-2-yn-1-ol (20c), yield
1.15 g (96%). IR (neat) 3391, 3299, 1446, 1014, 950 cm-1; 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.75 (s, 6H), 2.44 (brs, 1H), 2.64 (d, 1H, J = 2.3 Hz),
3.50 (t, 2H, J = 6.3 Hz), 5.24-5.29 (m, 1H), 5.65 (d, 1H, J = 2.3 Hz),
7.19- 7.28 (m, 3H), 7.68-7.71 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 18.0,
25.7, 31.3, 61.8, 74.7, 83.6, 122.8, 126.5, 126.8, 128.8, 129.7, 133.1,
137.8, 139.4.
