$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Treatment of aldehyde 49 at -78 °C with vinylalane 50, prepared via
Negishi carboalumination38 in the absence of water, led in less than 1
min to addition product 25 as a modest 3:1 mixture of diastereomers. In
the presence of stoichiometric quantities of water, the vinylalane also
rapidly added to this aldehyde, but now in 8:1 diastereocontrol (Scheme
9).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective ((3:1 ratio of diastereomers)), alternate preparations
also described
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Transition-Metal-Mediated Cascade Reactions: The Water-Accelerated
Carboalumination-Claisen Rearrangement-Carbonyl Addition Reaction
